at Community \n-Fun game-play loop\n-Consistent updates/Vocal Dev team\n-Stable online experience\n-You get to be a Dwarf 9.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1642289756, "timestamp_updated": 1642289756, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108097006", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040709156", "personaname": "Walfas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/laserlife/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 1355, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1287, "last_played": 1767152935, "avatar": "a6f3cbe33f68b9aa4e53297d4b9f5a63ee63ba63"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game has so many ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ bugs, I don't even know how the devs get away with it.\n\nPretty good though, the updates have come a long way even though they don't get rid of ANY of the bugs. Get a few friends to help you and you'll be able to squash some of the bugs enough to actually get through missions.", "timestamp_created": 1642289651, "timestamp_updated": 1642289651, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108094886", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057105304", "personaname": "Kabastian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057105304/", "num_games_owned": 231, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 7719, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1437, "last_played": 1783624530, "avatar": "debc5c5c0402b72ae149375b16c351152e6c31cc"